# ParaView state notes for PhaseForge 3D
#
# This is a lightweight state companion. Full GUI states are version-specific.
# Open the case with the .foam file, then apply:
#   Contour on alpha.water = 0.5
#   Camera azimuth 32 deg, elevation 22 deg, perspective on
#   White background
#   Transparent channel outline (Extract Surface / Feature Edges)
#
# Case: simulations/cfd/phaseforge_channel_3d/phaseforge_3d.foam
# HPHT: simulations/cfd/phaseforge_channel_3d_hpht/phaseforge_3d.foam
#
# See docs/paraview_manual_open.md
